{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/6afbfea334983981066e0c59c11bded8.avif?t=1772928902\" width=1560 height=217 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moving portals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move portals freely across the environment to create new paths and unexpected solutions. By repositioning portals on different surfaces, you can reshape how spaces connect and navigate puzzles in ways that defy normal logic. Each challenge encourages experimentation as you learn to think with portals and uncover creative solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/7088e64ec96b60281a30971389c8852c.poster.avif?t=1772928902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/7088e64ec96b60281a30971389c8852c.webm?t=1772928902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/7088e64ec96b60281a30971389c8852c.mp4?t=1772928902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity &amp; Mass </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate scale and gravity to approach puzzles from entirely new perspectives. Grow or shrink to change how the environment behaves, and shift gravity to walk across surfaces that once seemed unreachable. Combining these mechanics opens new possibilities and transforms familiar spaces into completely different challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/b580d71248932496a086aa1b1ae2b4d5.poster.avif?t=1772928902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/b580d71248932496a086aa1b1ae2b4d5.webm?t=1772928902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/b580d71248932496a086aa1b1ae2b4d5.mp4?t=1772928902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A desert world </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remnants of a dying desert world and step into surreal dimensions beyond it. Each dimension introduces strange architecture, impossible structures, and new puzzles waiting to be solved. As you progress, fragments of this fading world reveal the mystery behind the portals and the realities they connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/6592768a777531b535baadf85d5e9120.poster.avif?t=1772928902\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/6592768a777531b535baadf85d5e9120.webm?t=1772928902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/extras/6592768a777531b535baadf85d5e9120.mp4?t=1772928902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040750?t=1772928902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/9181553407326e82106fa07e6d5f1c8406c89273/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772928902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/53faeacfefa38ec4c3ee2e3e32a8b90e3e69feeb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772928902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040750/53faeacfefa38ec4c3ee2e3e32a8b90e3e69feeb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t